WEBVTT

1
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:54,246
Kitana...

2
00:00:54,330 --> 00:00:55,539
I have something for you.

3
00:00:56,666 --> 00:00:57,792
It will protect you.

4
00:00:59,669 --> 00:01:01,379
It's beautiful, Father.

5
00:01:03,381 --> 00:01:05,299
This was a gift from Lord Raiden.

6
00:01:05,383 --> 00:01:06,509
The God of Thunder.

7
00:01:08,094 --> 00:01:10,429
If anything were to happen to me,

8
00:01:10,513 --> 00:01:12,348
he's always listening.

9
00:01:19,689 --> 00:01:21,941
Shao Kahn is arriving, Your Majesty.

10
00:01:22,024 --> 00:01:24,193
What happens if you lose?

11
00:01:25,611 --> 00:01:26,904
Don't worry about that.

12
00:01:26,987 --> 00:01:28,864
But what if he's too strong?

13
00:01:28,948 --> 00:01:30,700
Strength is not a closed fist.

14
00:01:31,325 --> 00:01:32,618
Strength is here,

15
00:01:33,744 --> 00:01:34,620
and here.

16
00:01:38,082 --> 00:01:39,500
Be strong, Kitana.

17
00:01:46,716 --> 00:01:51,095
Jerrod, our king! Jerrod, our king!

18
00:02:06,193 --> 00:02:09,071
<i>Shao Kahn, Emperor of Outworld,</i>

19
00:02:09,155 --> 00:02:12,241
<i>sought to unite the various realms
under one rule.</i>

20
00:02:12,783 --> 00:02:13,743
<i>His.</i>

21
00:02:15,453 --> 00:02:18,622
<i>But the Elder Gods had put
certain precautions in place.</i>

22
00:02:21,584 --> 00:02:24,837
<i>Our fates would not be settled
by the size of our armies.</i>

23
00:02:27,089 --> 00:02:30,718
<i>They would be decided by combat.</i>

24
00:02:31,761 --> 00:02:33,220
<i>The rules were simple.</i>

25
00:02:34,013 --> 00:02:37,308
<i>If one realm could win ten tournaments in a row,</i>

26
00:02:37,391 --> 00:02:40,019
<i>it would be given dominion over the other.</i>

27
00:02:40,686 --> 00:02:43,981
<i>Outworld would be allowed
to pillage Edenia's resources.</i>

28
00:02:45,483 --> 00:02:47,151
<i>Enslave our people.</i>

29
00:02:51,572 --> 00:02:55,117
<i>This was the final tournament.
Our last chance.</i>

30
00:02:56,035 --> 00:02:58,996
<i>All of our greatest warriors had already fallen.</i>

31
00:03:00,581 --> 00:03:02,166
<i>Only one fighter remained.</i>

32
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,168
<i>My father,</i>

33
00:03:05,795 --> 00:03:07,755
<i>King Jerrod of Edenia.</i>

34
00:03:09,340 --> 00:03:12,301
<i>But he faced Outworld's greatest warrior.</i>

35
00:03:14,512 --> 00:03:16,639
<i>Shao Kahn himself.</i>

36
00:03:27,066 --> 00:03:30,069
They will never bow to you.

37
00:03:31,237 --> 00:03:32,863
We shall see.

38
00:04:29,420 --> 00:04:30,421
Never!

39
00:05:26,185 --> 00:05:27,728
Kitana, close your eyes.

40
00:05:28,604 --> 00:05:30,439
Close your eyes right now.

41
00:05:44,161 --> 00:05:47,039
No!

42
00:05:47,122 --> 00:05:48,999
No!

43
00:05:51,418 --> 00:05:54,463
No!

44
00:06:25,244 --> 00:06:28,580
Edenia now belongs to me.

45
00:07:06,869 --> 00:07:09,788
Kneel. Or you'll die.

46
00:08:17,481 --> 00:08:19,942
Your father shouldn't have brought you here.

47
00:08:31,662 --> 00:08:34,373
Kitana, you're my daughter now.

48
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,805
Kitana!

49
00:09:26,592 --> 00:09:27,426
Yield.

50
00:09:47,362 --> 00:09:49,072
You cannot be serious.

51
00:09:49,781 --> 00:09:52,117
You're the one who taught me,
everything's a weapon.

52
00:10:00,751 --> 00:10:02,044
You yield.

53
00:10:16,475 --> 00:10:17,559
What do you have there?

54
00:10:18,143 --> 00:10:19,269
It's nothing.

55
00:10:21,021 --> 00:10:21,939
Jade.

56
00:10:24,274 --> 00:10:25,817
It was 20 years ago today

57
00:10:25,901 --> 00:10:27,903
the Emperor named me as your bodyguard.

58
00:10:29,238 --> 00:10:31,657
I know what Shao Kahn took from you.

59
00:10:31,740 --> 00:10:33,784
And if you had been vicious or cruel to me,

60
00:10:33,867 --> 00:10:35,160
no one would have blamed you,

61
00:10:35,244 --> 00:10:37,829
but you treated me like family.

62
00:10:38,914 --> 00:10:40,040
Like a sister.

63
00:10:42,167 --> 00:10:43,627
You are my sister.

64
00:10:44,628 --> 00:10:46,338
In every way that matters.

65
00:10:49,341 --> 00:10:53,011
Um, I got you something.
For the tournament.

66
00:10:57,975 --> 00:10:59,643
I was told that a proper princess

67
00:10:59,726 --> 00:11:02,771
is supposed to sit around
on pillows, fanning herself.

68
00:11:03,981 --> 00:11:05,065
Then I thought

69
00:11:05,774 --> 00:11:08,527
you are not exactly the pillow type.

70
00:11:13,115 --> 00:11:14,616
These are amazing.

71
00:11:27,713 --> 00:11:28,880
Hello, Mother.

72
00:11:30,132 --> 00:11:33,010
I was beginning to think you were avoiding me.

73
00:11:33,635 --> 00:11:36,221
I've been busy.
Training for the tournament.

74
00:11:37,973 --> 00:11:40,017
Good.
Because I have petitioned

75
00:11:40,100 --> 00:11:42,102
the Elder Gods for the tournament to begin.

76
00:11:42,894 --> 00:11:45,439
Let Raiden scrounge for his little champions.

77
00:11:45,981 --> 00:11:48,150
They will simply be the first to die

78
00:11:48,775 --> 00:11:50,068
and Earthrealm will be mine.

79
00:11:56,992 --> 00:11:58,118
Why is he here?

80
00:11:58,702 --> 00:12:00,746
I have a task for Shang Tsung.

81
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:04,750
I hope you bring good news, Sorcerer.

82
00:12:04,833 --> 00:12:06,835
My spies have located the relic.

83
00:12:07,878 --> 00:12:09,838
It was last seen in Raiden's temple

84
00:12:09,921 --> 00:12:12,424
where it was stolen by the mercenary, Kano.

85
00:12:13,467 --> 00:12:15,177
We seek the Amulet of Shinnok.

86
00:12:16,136 --> 00:12:18,597
It is said the amulet can heal any wound.

87
00:12:18,680 --> 00:12:21,224
Transform a man into a god.

88
00:12:21,308 --> 00:12:22,851
To charge the amulet would require

89
00:12:22,934 --> 00:12:25,062
an impossible amount of power.

90
00:12:25,145 --> 00:12:27,731
We would need to capture a star from the heavens.

91
00:12:27,814 --> 00:12:30,859
A star...

92
00:12:30,942 --> 00:12:32,277
or a god.

93
00:12:33,445 --> 00:12:35,697
Outworld has issued their challenge

94
00:12:35,781 --> 00:12:37,407
and the Elder Gods have spoken.

95
00:12:37,491 --> 00:12:41,078
When the sand is gone,
the first round will begin.

96
00:12:42,079 --> 00:12:43,955
Mortal Kombat is upon us

97
00:12:44,664 --> 00:12:48,001
and yet we are still short one champion.

98
00:13:42,264 --> 00:13:43,974
It's showtime.

99
00:14:23,972 --> 00:14:26,224
You should have brought more guys.

100
00:14:59,508 --> 00:15:01,384
Man, Johnny Cage got old as fuck.

101
00:15:07,432 --> 00:15:08,642
<i>Attention fans,</i>

102
00:15:08,725 --> 00:15:11,394
<i>don't miss your chance to meet
your favorite influencers</i>

103
00:15:11,478 --> 00:15:14,189
<i>and YouTube stars in Autograph Alley.</i>

104
00:15:14,272 --> 00:15:15,857
All right, everyone, get in close.

105
00:15:15,941 --> 00:15:17,025
Black Orchid!

106
00:15:27,160 --> 00:15:28,328
<i>It's showtime.</i>

107
00:15:44,344 --> 00:15:45,345
Johnny Cage.

108
00:15:46,179 --> 00:15:48,139
Hey, guys. I'm off the clock.

109
00:15:49,266 --> 00:15:52,769
Mr. Cage, you have been chosen
for Mortal Kombat.

110
00:15:52,852 --> 00:15:54,771
Mortal Kombat, huh?

111
00:15:54,854 --> 00:15:56,898
What's that? Some kind of fan film?

112
00:15:56,982 --> 00:15:58,817
It's a fighting tournament.

113
00:15:58,900 --> 00:16:01,486
Yeah, not really my thing anymore.

114
00:16:03,738 --> 00:16:04,948
Unless it's a paying gig?

115
00:16:05,490 --> 00:16:07,993
More like a "fate of the entire human race" gig.

116
00:16:08,076 --> 00:16:10,370
Tell me you're not some crazy fans.

117
00:16:10,954 --> 00:16:12,247
Definitely not fans.

118
00:16:12,330 --> 00:16:13,290
All right. All right.

119
00:16:13,373 --> 00:16:14,624
You don't have to say "definitely."

120
00:16:14,708 --> 00:16:15,709
You have been chosen

121
00:16:15,792 --> 00:16:17,544
as one of the champions of Earthrealm.

122
00:16:18,295 --> 00:16:20,964
The gods have selected you, Mr. Cage.

123
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:24,342
All right, I think it's time
for you guys to fuck off.

124
00:16:24,426 --> 00:16:26,553
But, hey, love the cosplay. What's that?

125
00:16:26,636 --> 00:16:28,847
<i>Big Trouble in Little China?</i>
Fantastic film.

126
00:16:28,930 --> 00:16:30,223
Listen, I know what it sounds like,

127
00:16:30,307 --> 00:16:31,766
but he's telling the truth.

128
00:16:31,850 --> 00:16:35,020
Very soon the champions will be summoned to fight

129
00:16:35,103 --> 00:16:36,521
and you will be among them.

130
00:16:36,605 --> 00:16:38,231
The fate of your world

131
00:16:38,315 --> 00:16:40,191
rests on the outcome of this tournament.

132
00:16:40,942 --> 00:16:43,486
Fantastic. I will see you there.

133
00:16:43,570 --> 00:16:45,363
Thanks for coming, drive safe,

134
00:16:45,447 --> 00:16:47,449
and, uh, say hi to Dumbledore for me.

135
00:16:47,532 --> 00:16:49,075
You're gonna have to show him.

136
00:17:03,715 --> 00:17:05,175
Holy shit.

137
00:17:05,925 --> 00:17:07,385
How are you doing that?

138
00:17:07,469 --> 00:17:09,220
Come with us, Mr. Cage,

139
00:17:09,304 --> 00:17:11,931
and discover the man you were meant to be.

140
00:17:18,521 --> 00:17:20,106
Now, are you coming or what?

141
00:17:45,674 --> 00:17:46,883
Where the hell am I?

142
00:17:48,677 --> 00:17:50,595
It's okay.
You're still on Earth.

143
00:17:50,679 --> 00:17:52,389
Welcome to Raiden's Sky Temple.

144
00:17:58,978 --> 00:18:00,647
Watch this.

145
00:18:02,148 --> 00:18:04,943
Robot arms. That dude's got robot arms.

146
00:18:06,403 --> 00:18:07,862
We served in the Army together.

147
00:18:07,946 --> 00:18:09,739
That's Jax Briggs. Special Forces.

148
00:18:11,241 --> 00:18:12,450
That's Cole Young.

149
00:18:12,534 --> 00:18:14,828
His suit absorbs attacks and makes him stronger.

150
00:18:15,787 --> 00:18:17,288
He's a descendant of Scorpion.

151
00:18:17,372 --> 00:18:19,332
One of Earthrealm's greatest warriors.

152
00:18:20,417 --> 00:18:21,459
Oh.

153
00:18:21,543 --> 00:18:22,669
That's Liu Kang.

154
00:18:23,503 --> 00:18:25,130
He's the best fighter we got.

155
00:18:33,513 --> 00:18:35,849
- He shoots fire?
- Mm-hmm.

156
00:18:37,892 --> 00:18:40,353
I feel like that's cheating, but okay.

157
00:18:41,563 --> 00:18:42,689
It kind of feels like bullshit

158
00:18:42,772 --> 00:18:44,441
that y'all have these crazy powers

159
00:18:44,524 --> 00:18:46,693
and I'm just, you know, incredibly handsome.

160
00:18:47,986 --> 00:18:49,320
It could take months of training

161
00:18:49,404 --> 00:18:50,530
to unlock your powers.

162
00:18:51,239 --> 00:18:52,490
We don't have that kind of time.

163
00:18:52,574 --> 00:18:53,950
Yeah, well, whose fault is that?

164
00:18:54,033 --> 00:18:55,326
I mean, if you knew this was coming,

165
00:18:55,410 --> 00:18:57,078
why'd you wait till the last second to find me?

166
00:18:57,162 --> 00:18:59,873
We used to have
another champion. Kung Lao.

167
00:18:59,956 --> 00:19:01,541
Oh, great, so I'm just the fucking sub.

168
00:19:01,624 --> 00:19:03,752
He was murdered. By Shang Tsung.

169
00:19:03,835 --> 00:19:06,004
Wait. Murdered?

170
00:19:07,756 --> 00:19:09,966
Come on. You can't be serious. Right?

171
00:19:10,508 --> 00:19:12,761
I mean, that's, like, gotta be against the rules.

172
00:19:13,261 --> 00:19:15,221
You can't just go around killing people.

173
00:19:16,681 --> 00:19:19,184
It's called Mortal Kombat for a reason.

174
00:19:20,310 --> 00:19:23,688
Yo, Gandalf, send me back.
I wanna go back.

175
00:19:23,772 --> 00:19:26,065
- Johnny, wait.
- No. No.

176
00:19:26,149 --> 00:19:27,901
You said tournament which implies rules,

177
00:19:27,984 --> 00:19:30,069
and a referee, and I don't know, maybe a medic.

178
00:19:30,153 --> 00:19:32,197
Not some fucking <i>Squid Game</i> murder party.

179
00:19:32,280 --> 00:19:34,407
Dude wants to quit, just let him go.

180
00:19:34,491 --> 00:19:35,492
We don't need him.

181
00:19:35,575 --> 00:19:38,703
Look, you wanna step in the octagon

182
00:19:38,787 --> 00:19:40,330
with a bunch of happy assholes

183
00:19:40,413 --> 00:19:43,374
that don't know how to lose, go right ahead.

184
00:19:43,458 --> 00:19:46,085
But I don't have Transformer arms,

185
00:19:46,169 --> 00:19:48,755
or shoot lightning bolts or fireballs,

186
00:19:48,838 --> 00:19:51,299
or do whatever the fuck it is Flame Fingers does,

187
00:19:51,382 --> 00:19:54,219
so forgive me if I don't sign up to get mulched.

188
00:19:58,181 --> 00:20:00,099
You are not wrong, Mr. Cage.

189
00:20:08,441 --> 00:20:10,193
Nine times, we have been challenged.

190
00:20:10,276 --> 00:20:12,070
And nine times, we have lost.

191
00:20:12,153 --> 00:20:13,947
And now, 20 years later,

192
00:20:14,030 --> 00:20:16,991
Shao Kahn seeks to add
Earthrealm to his dominion.

193
00:20:18,159 --> 00:20:20,954
This is a war for the fate of your world.

194
00:20:22,121 --> 00:20:24,916
Look, Cage, I get it. We all do.

195
00:20:24,999 --> 00:20:27,043
Some stupid fucking cosmic lottery

196
00:20:27,126 --> 00:20:29,796
decided that we're the ones
that get to save the world.

197
00:20:32,549 --> 00:20:34,092
Shit is terrifying.

198
00:20:34,717 --> 00:20:35,718
You wanna know the last thing I did

199
00:20:35,802 --> 00:20:36,803
before coming here?

200
00:20:36,886 --> 00:20:40,265
I said goodbye to my wife and my little girl.

201
00:20:40,348 --> 00:20:43,518
The two most important things in my life.

202
00:20:43,601 --> 00:20:44,978
And there's a damn good chance

203
00:20:45,061 --> 00:20:46,479
I'm never gonna see them again.

204
00:20:48,314 --> 00:20:49,357
And I'm okay with that.

205
00:20:50,775 --> 00:20:53,611
Because I know if I die out there,
I'm dying for them.

206
00:20:55,029 --> 00:20:57,740
We lose one more time, the Earth is gone.

207
00:20:57,824 --> 00:21:00,326
And our only chance is to face this together.

208
00:21:00,910 --> 00:21:05,290
You, Johnny Cage, are a part of this now.

209
00:21:14,257 --> 00:21:15,425
Fuck that.

210
00:21:15,508 --> 00:21:17,093
Johnny, even if you walk away,

211
00:21:17,176 --> 00:21:18,928
the Elder Gods can still summon you to fight.

212
00:21:19,012 --> 00:21:20,096
Not if they can't find me.

213
00:21:20,179 --> 00:21:21,848
So what are you gonna do, huh?

214
00:21:21,931 --> 00:21:23,308
You just going to go hide?

215
00:21:23,391 --> 00:21:25,435
No, first I'm gonna drink
every beer on the planet,

216
00:21:25,518 --> 00:21:26,603
then I'm going to hide.

217
00:21:26,686 --> 00:21:28,438
Because this shit's got nothing to do with me.

218
00:21:28,521 --> 00:21:30,523
I'm not some great warrior.

219
00:21:30,607 --> 00:21:32,108
I'm not some champion.

220
00:21:32,191 --> 00:21:34,235
Okay? I'm an actor.

221
00:21:34,319 --> 00:21:35,320
Hmm.

222
00:21:36,613 --> 00:21:37,906
And before that, you were the guy

223
00:21:37,989 --> 00:21:40,199
with five black belts and a world title.

224
00:21:42,201 --> 00:21:44,954
Yeah, I saw some of those old fights.

225
00:21:46,039 --> 00:21:49,250
Man, you could have been one of the best.

226
00:21:49,334 --> 00:21:52,128
But I wasn't.
And that was a long time ago.

227
00:21:52,211 --> 00:21:55,006
That guy you want is dead and buried.

228
00:21:56,007 --> 00:21:58,259
Or maybe he's still in there, trying to get out.

229
00:22:18,821 --> 00:22:19,822
Hey, listen...

230
00:22:21,908 --> 00:22:24,077
I'm like 90% sure I had an aneurysm

231
00:22:24,160 --> 00:22:26,496
and this is some kind of fucked up coma dream,

232
00:22:28,665 --> 00:22:30,500
but on the off chance this shit is real,

233
00:22:32,210 --> 00:22:34,253
best of luck with the whole
saving the world thing.

234
00:22:49,852 --> 00:22:53,022
You should know that when you died,

235
00:22:53,106 --> 00:22:57,443
it was not your so-called friends
who brought you back.

236
00:22:58,611 --> 00:23:00,822
It was not Lord Raiden,

237
00:23:01,614 --> 00:23:03,491
the Great Pretender.

238
00:23:05,451 --> 00:23:07,495
It was Shao Kahn.

239
00:23:08,913 --> 00:23:10,581
Rise now,

240
00:23:11,457 --> 00:23:15,086
as a champion of Outworld.

241
00:23:21,718 --> 00:23:25,013
Sire, we retrieved the package.

242
00:23:27,432 --> 00:23:28,433
Quan Chi!

243
00:23:29,267 --> 00:23:31,728
I am told you sent your followers to Earthrealm.

244
00:23:31,811 --> 00:23:32,979
What were they doing there?

245
00:23:33,062 --> 00:23:35,982
Simply retrieving some lost property, my lady.

246
00:23:36,858 --> 00:23:38,651
By order of your father.

247
00:23:41,279 --> 00:23:42,280
What is that?

248
00:23:46,909 --> 00:23:48,703
I believe it's called...

249
00:23:49,620 --> 00:23:50,830
a "Kano."

250
00:23:55,877 --> 00:23:57,587
One Sling Dog please.

251
00:24:03,384 --> 00:24:04,552
You're Johnny Cage.

252
00:24:05,678 --> 00:24:07,346
That's what the tab says.

253
00:24:07,430 --> 00:24:08,973
Holy shit.

254
00:24:09,515 --> 00:24:12,977
I freaking loved <i>Citizen Cage</i> when I was a kid.

255
00:24:14,854 --> 00:24:16,439
Thanks, man. I appreciate it.

256
00:24:18,483 --> 00:24:19,901
Dude, you know what they should do?

257
00:24:21,194 --> 00:24:23,237
They should do another <i>Citizen Cage.</i>

258
00:24:23,321 --> 00:24:24,739
Like a reboot.

259
00:24:25,740 --> 00:24:27,658
Come on, man. Give me a break.

260
00:24:28,284 --> 00:24:29,160
Nobody wants that.

261
00:24:29,952 --> 00:24:30,787
What?

262
00:24:30,870 --> 00:24:32,038
You think the world is crying out

263
00:24:32,121 --> 00:24:35,166
for a Johnny Cage comeback? Huh?

264
00:24:36,084 --> 00:24:38,503
No. They want gritty,
they want grounded,

265
00:24:38,586 --> 00:24:39,504
