266
00:24:39,587 --> 00:24:41,756
murdering a thousand fucking dudes with a pencil.

267
00:24:41,839 --> 00:24:43,674
That's what people wanna see.

268
00:24:45,593 --> 00:24:49,388
Not some dinosaur doing a bunch of karate poses.

269
00:24:50,681 --> 00:24:52,433
That shit went out in the '90s.

270
00:24:56,562 --> 00:24:58,022
I thought it was pretty cool.

271
00:25:43,526 --> 00:25:45,278
Where's my fucking eye?

272
00:25:49,407 --> 00:25:50,491
Blondie.

273
00:25:51,909 --> 00:25:53,327
The tournament has begun.

274
00:25:54,328 --> 00:25:55,997
Today you fight for Earthrealm.

275
00:25:56,080 --> 00:25:58,166
For the lives of everyone you have ever known.

276
00:25:58,249 --> 00:26:01,544
If you fail, the Earth fails with you.

277
00:26:02,253 --> 00:26:05,214
Two of our champions
will be chosen to compete today.

278
00:26:05,882 --> 00:26:06,883
The winners will advance

279
00:26:06,966 --> 00:26:08,676
to the next stage of the tournament.

280
00:26:09,302 --> 00:26:11,679
The losers will be eliminated.

281
00:26:11,762 --> 00:26:13,222
To the death.

282
00:26:13,306 --> 00:26:15,099
That is up to the winner.

283
00:26:16,058 --> 00:26:17,101
Maybe don't lose.

284
00:26:23,024 --> 00:26:25,193
Well, looks like it's my lucky day.

285
00:26:25,276 --> 00:26:27,320
Blade, you got this.

286
00:26:33,576 --> 00:26:35,411
I thought you said two of us were fighting.

287
00:26:40,166 --> 00:26:43,753
<i>It's Johnny Cage
with a brutal hit. He's down.</i>

288
00:26:43,836 --> 00:26:45,755
<i>It's official.</i>

289
00:26:45,838 --> 00:26:48,466
<i>Johnny Cage just became the youngest minor</i>

290
00:26:48,549 --> 00:26:50,092
<i>to ever win this tournament.</i>

291
00:26:50,176 --> 00:26:52,678
<i>This young man is destined for greatness.</i>

292
00:26:56,641 --> 00:26:58,184
You seem a little down, Johnny.

293
00:26:59,310 --> 00:27:01,145
You're normally a little more animated.

294
00:27:08,069 --> 00:27:09,487
<i>Uno más,</i> thanks, Ed.

295
00:27:29,882 --> 00:27:31,175
Oh, shit.

296
00:27:37,181 --> 00:27:38,349
I don't know what you're on about.

297
00:27:38,432 --> 00:27:39,558
The amulet of what now?

298
00:27:39,642 --> 00:27:41,519
Shinnok. Pay attention!

299
00:27:41,602 --> 00:27:43,187
Don't look at me with that tone of voice,

300
00:27:43,271 --> 00:27:44,647
you big bleached dildo.

301
00:27:44,730 --> 00:27:47,483
I've just been dead.
And my fucking eye's AWOL.

302
00:27:47,566 --> 00:27:50,778
Stop your incessant whinging.
We can build you another.

303
00:27:50,861 --> 00:27:52,905
Why is he not a Revenant like the rest of them?

304
00:27:52,989 --> 00:27:55,324
He was not worth the time or the effort.

305
00:27:55,408 --> 00:27:58,035
This one barely has a soul left to corrupt.

306
00:27:58,119 --> 00:28:00,454
Ha! You hear that? A fucking loophole.

307
00:28:00,538 --> 00:28:01,872
Go, you good thing.

308
00:28:01,956 --> 00:28:05,126
Where is the amulet you took
from Raiden's temple?

309
00:28:05,209 --> 00:28:06,711
I don't know, probably in my pocket

310
00:28:06,794 --> 00:28:08,129
where I keep all the shit I steal.

311
00:28:09,839 --> 00:28:11,507
Oh, right-oh.

312
00:28:13,926 --> 00:28:17,305
Here we go. How about...

313
00:28:17,972 --> 00:28:19,932
Nah, different temple. Well, hold on.

314
00:28:20,850 --> 00:28:21,892
This could be...

315
00:28:22,393 --> 00:28:24,312
Yeah. Should call her.

316
00:28:25,271 --> 00:28:28,316
Ah! Here we are. Yahtzee.

317
00:28:28,941 --> 00:28:29,900
Oi!

318
00:28:29,984 --> 00:28:31,193
We could have left him dead.

319
00:28:31,277 --> 00:28:33,029
Hey! First off, fuck off.

320
00:28:33,112 --> 00:28:34,947
And you, where are you going with that?

321
00:28:36,198 --> 00:28:37,825
I will take it to my father.

322
00:28:39,160 --> 00:28:40,536
Unfortunately, Princess,

323
00:28:40,619 --> 00:28:42,955
it appears you are needed elsewhere.

324
00:28:45,291 --> 00:28:46,876
Oi, you creepy fucking mime.

325
00:28:46,959 --> 00:28:48,836
I stole that fair and square.

326
00:28:50,212 --> 00:28:51,589
Good luck.

327
00:29:12,318 --> 00:29:14,195
Each flame represents a fighter.

328
00:29:14,987 --> 00:29:16,489
The tournament ends when one side

329
00:29:16,572 --> 00:29:18,074
has no champions left.

330
00:29:18,949 --> 00:29:20,910
Hey. How's it going, babe?

331
00:29:22,828 --> 00:29:25,247
Listen, I'm warning you,

332
00:29:26,248 --> 00:29:29,210
I got a Saturn Award
for best fight in a feature film,

333
00:29:29,293 --> 00:29:30,544
so don't mess with me.

334
00:29:34,673 --> 00:29:37,218
Whoa! Whoa. Easy, all right?

335
00:29:37,301 --> 00:29:39,637
Let's just take a timeout here and talk about it.

336
00:29:39,720 --> 00:29:42,473
Okay? I really don't feel
comfortable hitting a girl.

337
00:29:44,016 --> 00:29:46,310
Don't worry, you won't.

338
00:29:57,863 --> 00:29:59,698
Whoa! Come on. Easy.
Let's just talk about this.

339
00:30:22,680 --> 00:30:24,140
Why are you so fucking mean?

340
