Finish him!

341
00:32:32,476 --> 00:32:33,477
Hmm.

342
00:32:57,668 --> 00:33:00,254
It appears your side is already down a man.

343
00:33:01,463 --> 00:33:02,506
Tragic.

344
00:33:05,467 --> 00:33:06,510
And who are you?

345
00:33:07,011 --> 00:33:09,638
Sindel. High Queen of Edenia.

346
00:33:09,722 --> 00:33:12,016
Consort to the great Shao Kahn.

347
00:33:12,099 --> 00:33:14,018
They send their queen to fight?

348
00:33:14,518 --> 00:33:17,730
No. We send our best to fight.

349
00:33:17,813 --> 00:33:18,731
Oh.

350
00:33:19,481 --> 00:33:21,942
No offense, babe,
but you look really fucking dead.

351
00:33:22,026 --> 00:33:24,236
I was freed from my mortal bonds.

352
00:33:24,320 --> 00:33:25,446
Shao Kahn showed me

353
00:33:25,529 --> 00:33:27,197
the pleasures of a life eternal.

354
00:33:31,869 --> 00:33:33,787
Perhaps I'll do the same for you.

355
00:33:43,672 --> 00:33:44,965
What a pretty trick.

356
00:33:46,050 --> 00:33:47,593
Would you like to see mine?

357
00:33:48,469 --> 00:33:50,095
No, actually I'm good.

358
00:34:13,202 --> 00:34:15,579
Fuck you! You stupid bitch!

359
00:35:22,521 --> 00:35:24,398
It appears our sides are now even.

360
00:35:29,987 --> 00:35:31,196
What'd I miss?

361
00:35:31,905 --> 00:35:34,032
Fuck yeah! Look who's back.

362
00:35:35,993 --> 00:35:37,828
Well? How bad was it?

363
00:35:37,911 --> 00:35:41,623
Zombie queen. Pit of spikes. Yeah.

364
00:35:41,707 --> 00:35:43,208
- So pretty goddamn bad.
- Ow.

365
00:35:45,335 --> 00:35:46,545
- You okay?
- Yeah.

366
00:35:50,841 --> 00:35:51,967
What happened?

367
00:35:52,050 --> 00:35:54,344
You were eliminated from the tournament.

368
00:35:55,471 --> 00:35:56,555
You lost.

369
00:35:56,638 --> 00:35:59,433
You are lucky, she was charitable
and let you live.

370
00:36:07,357 --> 00:36:09,109
Oi! Pennywise.

371
00:36:09,193 --> 00:36:11,403
I've been looking all over this shithole for you.

372
00:36:11,487 --> 00:36:13,030
You promised me a new eye.

373
00:36:13,113 --> 00:36:14,740
And it better be one that shoots lasers.

374
00:36:15,282 --> 00:36:18,285
- I have other priorities.
- Like fucking what?

375
00:36:18,368 --> 00:36:19,828
If it's putting on more eyeliner,

376
00:36:19,912 --> 00:36:21,371
trust me, you're good.

377
00:36:21,455 --> 00:36:22,748
All right? Come on, mate.

378
00:36:22,831 --> 00:36:25,292
I am bumping into shit left, right, and center.

379
00:36:25,375 --> 00:36:27,085
I mean, my peripheral vision is fucked.

380
00:36:27,169 --> 00:36:28,921
Proper fucked, mate.

381
00:36:29,004 --> 00:36:30,923
So come on. Chop-chop. Let's get to it.

382
00:36:32,674 --> 00:36:34,051
Well, you don't have to do it right now.

383
00:36:34,134 --> 00:36:36,845
I mean, you need to,
you know, take a measurement.

384
00:36:36,929 --> 00:36:40,182
Check the color or wash your grubby little hands.

385
00:36:43,477 --> 00:36:44,853
All right, let's have a look.

386
00:36:44,937 --> 00:36:47,856
Don't fucking roll it on
the fucking ground, you grub!

387
00:36:49,316 --> 00:36:51,026
Oi, the amulet.

388
00:36:51,693 --> 00:36:54,279
I want that back.
And don't fucking roll it.

389
00:36:54,363 --> 00:36:57,074
You got your eye.
Now leave me alone.

390
00:36:57,157 --> 00:36:59,326
The amulet does not belong to you.

391
00:36:59,868 --> 00:37:01,745
Its powers are well beyond

392
00:37:01,829 --> 00:37:03,622
your meager understanding.

393
00:37:03,705 --> 00:37:04,706
Idiot.

394
00:37:04,790 --> 00:37:07,000
All right. Let's take
this baby for a test drive.

395
00:37:07,751 --> 00:37:09,837
All right.

396
00:37:10,963 --> 00:37:15,217
One, two, three. Oh! Fuck! Snug.

397
00:37:18,595 --> 00:37:20,597
Wow.

398
00:37:20,681 --> 00:37:23,016
Holy shit, is that HD?
That's pretty good.

399
00:37:23,100 --> 00:37:25,352
How many eyes you made?
Can you do me other one?

400
00:37:38,699 --> 00:37:40,534
You seem troubled, Mr. Cage.

401
00:37:42,369 --> 00:37:44,496
Yeah. Well, 'cause of me

402
00:37:44,580 --> 00:37:46,915
Earth's odds just got 20% worse.

403
00:37:47,624 --> 00:37:49,835
I had a chance to actually
do something worth a damn

404
00:37:49,918 --> 00:37:51,503
and I screwed it all up.

405
00:37:51,587 --> 00:37:55,674
So, yeah, I'd say "troubled"
just about sums it up.

406
00:38:03,932 --> 00:38:06,977
What are those? Pills?

407
00:38:07,060 --> 00:38:08,395
Huh?

408
00:38:09,354 --> 00:38:10,772
Are they magic fighting pills?

409
00:38:11,857 --> 00:38:14,067
Is that...
Is that how you get your powers?

410
00:38:23,452 --> 00:38:24,536
Bird seed.

411
00:38:26,163 --> 00:38:29,249
Oh. Yeah, yeah, yeah. Bird seed. Yeah.

412
00:38:30,542 --> 00:38:33,962
Well, I thought you were gonna
give me some kind of lecture,

413
00:38:34,046 --> 00:38:37,549
but yeah, chores are good.

414
00:38:40,427 --> 00:38:41,970
You don't need a lecture.

415
00:38:42,054 --> 00:38:43,764
You need perspective.

416
00:38:43,847 --> 00:38:46,516
Perspective, huh?

417
00:38:46,600 --> 00:38:48,852
There are eight billion people on this planet

418
00:38:48,936 --> 00:38:51,063
and yet the gods chose you.

419
00:38:51,146 --> 00:38:53,148
Perhaps they saw your true potential

420
00:38:53,231 --> 00:38:54,816
as a champion of Earthrealm.

421
00:38:55,692 --> 00:38:57,235
Maybe they made a mistake.

422
00:38:57,319 --> 00:38:58,153
Maybe.

423
00:38:58,695 --> 00:39:01,823
If I see the Elder Gods,
I'll be sure to tell them.

424
00:39:06,578 --> 00:39:08,705
Well, I'm glad you find this all so amusing.

425
00:39:09,957 --> 00:39:13,460
Hey, great pep talk, by the way.
Just nailed it.

426
00:39:59,423 --> 00:40:00,424
Ouch.

427
00:40:01,883 --> 00:40:03,468
You have done this before?

428
00:40:04,469 --> 00:40:05,721
I've seen it done.

429
00:40:07,723 --> 00:40:09,057
All right.

430
00:40:14,187 --> 00:40:17,816
It's okay. The Princess Kitana
has been my eyes and ears

431
00:40:17,899 --> 00:40:19,860
inside the palace for many years now.

432
00:40:21,695 --> 00:40:23,655
We know the risk you took coming here.

433
00:40:23,739 --> 00:40:24,906
Thank you, Kitana.

434
00:40:24,990 --> 00:40:27,242
Wait, are you telling me I got my ass kicked

435
00:40:27,325 --> 00:40:28,493
by one of the good guys?

436
00:40:28,577 --> 00:40:31,288
I had to make it look real.
He was watching.

437
00:40:32,456 --> 00:40:34,541
They found the Amulet of Shinnok.

438
00:40:34,624 --> 00:40:35,625
It was in the possession

439
00:40:35,709 --> 00:40:37,210
of a dead sellsword named Kano.

440
00:40:37,794 --> 00:40:39,421
Son of a bitch.

441
00:40:39,504 --> 00:40:41,173
If the Emperor finds a way to charge the amulet,

442
00:40:41,256 --> 00:40:42,841
he would be unstoppable.

443
00:40:42,924 --> 00:40:44,634
It would be like fighting a god.

444
00:40:44,718 --> 00:40:47,179
Yeah, well, let's not do that.

445
00:40:47,971 --> 00:40:49,639
My friend is in the tournament.

446
00:40:50,891 --> 00:40:52,392
Jade was raised under Shao Kahn's army.

447
00:40:53,477 --> 00:40:57,355
Do what you must, but do not make her suffer.

448
00:41:09,659 --> 00:41:11,369
You went to another realm?

449
00:41:13,955 --> 00:41:15,457
You followed me?

450
00:41:15,540 --> 00:41:17,751
I am trying to keep you alive.

451
00:41:17,834 --> 00:41:18,835
By spying on your friend.

452
00:41:18,919 --> 00:41:21,546
By keeping my friend from making a mistake.

453
00:41:21,630 --> 00:41:24,633
You are conspiring
with Lord Raiden. The enemy.

454
00:41:25,342 --> 00:41:27,427
I swore an oath, Kitana.

455
00:41:28,261 --> 00:41:31,765
To serve as Shao Kahn's sword.

456
00:41:39,397 --> 00:41:41,233
The second round of the tournament

457
00:41:41,316 --> 00:41:42,818
will consist of three matches.

458
00:41:43,693 --> 00:41:46,530
Jax, Cole, Liu Kang.

459
00:42:03,880 --> 00:42:05,048
Kung Lao.

460
00:42:06,466 --> 00:42:08,176
I have been given new life.

461
00:42:09,427 --> 00:42:10,679
My son?

462
00:42:19,938 --> 00:42:23,400
Look at that.
Still part of this tournament.

463
00:42:23,483 --> 00:42:25,235
But that's not why I'm here.

464
00:42:34,161 --> 00:42:36,121
No!

465
00:42:36,204 --> 00:42:37,330
No!

466
00:42:48,967 --> 00:42:50,260
Attack now!

467
00:43:28,632 --> 00:43:33,386
Imagine what one could do with such power.

468
00:43:35,013 --> 00:43:39,351
Careful, Sorcerer, that doesn't belong to you.

469
00:43:46,942 --> 00:43:49,986
The amulet must be bound to a mortal soul.

470
00:43:50,070 --> 00:43:51,947
Once it has imprinted on you,

471
00:43:52,030 --> 00:43:53,990
Raiden's power will be yours.

472
00:43:54,574 --> 00:43:56,952
The amulet will give you immortality.

473
00:45:00,849 --> 00:45:04,185
Well, this is fucking ominous.

474
00:45:11,192 --> 00:45:12,986
I'm guessing you're Jade.

475
00:45:13,069 --> 00:45:14,904
Let's get this over with.

476
00:45:20,285 --> 00:45:23,121
I am told you carry the blood of Scorpion.

477
00:45:27,375 --> 00:45:29,169
I look forward to spilling it.

478
00:45:44,059 --> 00:45:45,894
You know you're fighting
on the wrong side, right?

479
00:45:57,030 --> 00:45:58,656
What the fuck do you have under there?

480
00:45:59,908 --> 00:46:01,534
Shit.

481
00:46:21,971 --> 00:46:22,889
Well, hello there.

482
00:46:31,689 --> 00:46:34,025
I hope your ancestors are watching.

483
00:47:05,849 --> 00:47:09,018
For what it is worth, I take no joy in this.

484
00:47:11,938 --> 00:47:13,940
Then you're really going to hate this shit.

485
00:47:19,320 --> 00:47:20,738
This is for my family.

486
00:47:21,990 --> 00:47:22,991
For my friends.

487
00:47:24,159 --> 00:47:25,618
For every moment that brought me here.

488
00:47:26,995 --> 00:47:30,373
This is for Earth, you son of a bitch.

489
00:48:18,963 --> 00:48:19,923
What?

490
00:48:44,822 --> 00:48:46,616
Give my regards to the dead.

491
00:48:55,708 --> 00:48:58,336
Go on, do it.

492
00:49:22,026 --> 00:49:23,027
Why?

493
00:49:23,987 --> 00:49:25,655
Your friend spared one of our guys.

494
00:49:27,073 --> 00:49:27,991
Now we're even.

495
00:49:28,950 --> 00:49:31,661
By the way, hell of a fight.

496
00:49:54,475 --> 00:49:57,437
Kung Lao, what have they done to you?

497
00:49:58,021 --> 00:49:59,897
Opened my eyes to the truth.

498
00:50:02,859 --> 00:50:03,860
What truth?

499
00:50:04,485 --> 00:50:08,489
Look around. The gods have
abandoned their creation.

500
00:50:09,407 --> 00:50:11,743
Only Shao Kahn can save us now.

501
00:50:12,702 --> 00:50:15,913
One of those gods raised you. Loved you.

502
00:50:17,332 --> 00:50:18,791
And you slit his throat.

503
00:51:24,691 --> 00:51:28,319
Stop. Kung Lao, remember who you are!

504
00:51:30,196 --> 00:51:31,781
You were my brother.

505
00:51:31,864 --> 00:51:34,575
And when you're dead, when your realm falls,

506
00:51:35,284 --> 00:51:37,120
we will be brothers again.

507
00:52:02,687 --> 00:52:04,105
Don't make me do this.

508
00:53:25,478 --> 00:53:26,938
I'll find a way to save you.

509
00:53:40,326 --> 00:53:42,245
I'm going to bring you back.

510
00:54:17,947 --> 00:54:20,908
But not today, brother.

511
00:54:40,761 --> 00:54:42,471
Raiden!

512
00:54:47,351 --> 00:54:50,521
- Is he?
- He's alive. Barely.

513
00:54:56,277 --> 00:54:57,737
He's been asking for you.

514
00:54:59,906 --> 00:55:00,907
Liu Kang.

515
00:55:07,955 --> 00:55:08,998
My son.

516
00:55:19,425 --> 00:55:20,426
What happened?

517
00:55:23,137 --> 00:55:24,180
I killed him.

518
00:55:25,473 --> 00:55:26,682
I didn't have a choice.

519
00:55:27,516 --> 00:55:28,517
I'm sorry.

520
00:55:33,105 --> 00:55:34,148
Where's Cole?

521
00:55:36,525 --> 00:55:37,735
He didn't come back?

522
00:55:40,947 --> 00:55:42,573
Oh, shit.

523
00:55:54,543 --> 00:55:55,795
Necromancer,

524
00:55:56,837 --> 00:55:59,090
give me your greatest warrior.

525
00:56:00,508 --> 00:56:02,510
The one they call Sub-Zero.

526
00:56:04,971 --> 00:56:06,973
<i>Bi-Han.</i>

527
00:56:16,941 --> 00:56:18,776
<i>Rise now.</i>

528
00:56:31,247 --> 00:56:32,873
I am reborn.

529
00:56:43,634 --> 00:56:45,928
Raiden's portal is already weakening.

