but to be honest, I wasn't really listening.

803
01:22:38,020 --> 01:22:41,649
I am Hanzo Hasashi of the Shirai Ryu

804
01:22:42,567 --> 01:22:45,778
and Hell bends to my command.

805
01:22:54,537 --> 01:22:55,997
Keeping the seat warm?

806
01:22:56,080 --> 01:22:59,083
Raiden has sent his last warriors to Netherrealm.

807
01:22:59,584 --> 01:23:01,335
They are going after the amulet.

808
01:23:02,295 --> 01:23:04,422
That means there's no one left
to guard Lord Raiden.

809
01:23:09,051 --> 01:23:11,262
If we lose that amulet, we lose everything.

810
01:23:12,555 --> 01:23:14,473
Shao Kahn will be stripped of power.

811
01:23:15,099 --> 01:23:16,601
And our empire would fall.

812
01:23:16,684 --> 01:23:18,060
Send me down there.

813
01:23:18,769 --> 01:23:21,397
I will protect the amulet
while you take care of Raiden.

814
01:23:21,480 --> 01:23:24,191
I would think your loyalties
would be with your princess.

815
01:23:24,275 --> 01:23:25,735
Kitana made her choice.

816
01:23:27,445 --> 01:23:28,696
I'm making mine.

817
01:23:51,177 --> 01:23:53,596
How the hell are we going to
find the amulet in this place?

818
01:23:57,767 --> 01:23:59,435
Bi-Han is here.

819
01:24:06,359 --> 01:24:08,069
Hanzo Hasashi,

820
01:24:08,986 --> 01:24:11,697
this is not your fight, old man.

821
01:24:11,781 --> 01:24:14,450
I'm not here for their war.

822
01:24:15,368 --> 01:24:18,329
I'm here for your life.

823
01:24:18,954 --> 01:24:20,998
You might be surprised.

824
01:24:21,082 --> 01:24:23,459
I'm not the same man you killed.

825
01:24:25,002 --> 01:24:27,505
I belong to the shadows now.

826
01:24:28,798 --> 01:24:30,883
And they belong to me.

827
01:24:48,567 --> 01:24:50,111
Looks like we're the main event.

828
01:24:50,820 --> 01:24:52,196
Let's kill this fucker.

829
01:25:03,749 --> 01:25:04,750
Just two more deaths

830
01:25:04,834 --> 01:25:06,794
and then Earthrealm belongs to me.

831
01:25:19,390 --> 01:25:20,307
Kano!

832
01:25:21,225 --> 01:25:24,019
Oi, where are you going?
This one's got the amulet.

833
01:25:52,047 --> 01:25:54,049
Vengeance will be mine.

834
01:26:12,818 --> 01:26:13,652
Kano!

835
01:26:17,072 --> 01:26:19,158
Now would be a good time
to use those powers, mate.

836
01:26:19,241 --> 01:26:20,367
What powers?

837
01:26:20,951 --> 01:26:22,620
Are you shitting me?
You don't have any powers?

838
01:26:23,537 --> 01:26:25,164
Just incredibly handsome.

839
01:26:25,247 --> 01:26:26,457
Oh, we're fucked.

840
01:26:30,586 --> 01:26:31,712
Grab it!

841
01:26:41,055 --> 01:26:42,097
I got it.

842
01:26:44,016 --> 01:26:45,392
How do we destroy it?

843
01:26:47,102 --> 01:26:48,646
Well fucked if I know.

844
01:26:48,729 --> 01:26:50,272
What do you mean you don't know?

845
01:26:50,356 --> 01:26:52,566
Mate, I found it for you.
Do I have to do everything?

846
01:26:53,150 --> 01:26:54,944
But this is your plan.

847
01:26:55,027 --> 01:26:56,028
Don't talk to me like that.

848
01:26:56,111 --> 01:26:58,030
Why don't you check the instructions on the back?

849
01:26:58,113 --> 01:27:00,074
Oh, yeah. Yeah, that's a good idea.

850
01:27:00,157 --> 01:27:01,575
Oh, here we go. Look.

851
01:27:01,659 --> 01:27:03,118
One ring to rule them all.

852
01:27:03,202 --> 01:27:05,329
One ring to go fuck yourself!

853
01:27:05,412 --> 01:27:06,497
Why don't you leave the jokes to me?

854
01:27:06,580 --> 01:27:07,706
You can stick to being a cunt.

855
01:27:10,292 --> 01:27:11,168
Well, run!

856
01:27:46,203 --> 01:27:47,830
I am the one you want.

857
01:28:13,689 --> 01:28:15,190
Ah, fuck!

858
01:29:07,993 --> 01:29:09,870
I finally understand.

859
01:29:13,290 --> 01:29:15,918
Raiden told me I am not the chosen one.

860
01:29:16,001 --> 01:29:18,462
Your death belongs to another.

861
01:29:24,385 --> 01:29:27,096
My journey is to bring back Kung Lao.

862
01:29:27,972 --> 01:29:29,515
This is not the end.

863
01:29:31,809 --> 01:29:33,519
It is only the beginning.

864
01:29:51,286 --> 01:29:52,246
Fight.

865
01:29:55,457 --> 01:29:58,752
Congratulations, daughter. We just won.

866
01:30:00,713 --> 01:30:02,506
Earthrealm is ours.

867
01:30:08,762 --> 01:30:09,763
No.

868
01:30:11,807 --> 01:30:13,726
One fighter still remains.

869
01:30:22,151 --> 01:30:24,445
I renounce Outworld.

870
01:30:24,528 --> 01:30:27,990
I renounce your legacy of pain and cruelty.

871
01:30:28,574 --> 01:30:30,743
I renounce you!

872
01:30:33,746 --> 01:30:36,540
Today I fight for Earthrealm!

873
01:30:58,979 --> 01:31:00,397
So be it.

874
01:31:50,948 --> 01:31:52,074
The amulet.

875
01:32:06,130 --> 01:32:07,131
Never!

876
01:32:34,032 --> 01:32:35,367
Get over here!

877
01:33:56,615 --> 01:33:58,033
Hello, sunshine.

878
01:34:10,379 --> 01:34:13,006
With fire, be cleansed.

879
01:34:25,269 --> 01:34:27,020
<i>Johnny Cage.</i>

880
01:34:58,385 --> 01:35:00,679
<i>There are eight billion people on this planet</i>

881
01:35:00,762 --> 01:35:02,848
<i>and yet the gods chose you.</i>

882
01:35:14,735 --> 01:35:16,611
You want to know my power?

883
01:35:17,571 --> 01:35:20,032
It doesn't have to end like this.

884
01:35:21,783 --> 01:35:23,785
You do not have to die.

885
01:35:26,079 --> 01:35:27,205
One of us does.

886
01:35:36,882 --> 01:35:38,717
For the first time in my life,

887
01:35:40,385 --> 01:35:43,180
I am Johnny fucking Cage.

888
01:36:15,253 --> 01:36:16,338
No.

889
01:36:17,214 --> 01:36:18,590
You should be dead.

890
01:36:19,466 --> 01:36:20,801
And you should be running.

891
01:36:44,533 --> 01:36:45,534
No.

892
01:37:55,687 --> 01:37:58,773
Weak. Just like your father.

893
01:38:13,288 --> 01:38:14,748
<i>Be strong, Kitana.</i>

894
01:38:36,686 --> 01:38:39,981
It's time for them to see you
for what you really are.

895
01:38:48,114 --> 01:38:49,449
Mortal.

896
01:39:12,138 --> 01:39:13,640
Stop. No.

897
01:39:15,308 --> 01:39:18,687
Please stand. Stand. Please.

898
01:39:25,944 --> 01:39:27,821
We are proud Edenians.

899
01:39:29,197 --> 01:39:31,074
We do not kneel.

900
01:39:37,581 --> 01:39:40,500
Kitana, our queen!

901
01:39:42,252 --> 01:39:45,672
Kitana, our queen!

902
01:39:46,464 --> 01:39:49,926
Kitana, our queen!

903
01:40:18,330 --> 01:40:20,123
<i>You want to know what makes a hero?</i>

904
01:40:25,003 --> 01:40:26,338
<i>It's not destiny.</i>

905
01:40:27,047 --> 01:40:28,757
<i>It's not something you're born with.</i>

906
01:40:31,217 --> 01:40:33,303
<i>It's discovering that sometimes</i>

907
01:40:33,386 --> 01:40:34,846
<i>even one small light</i>

908
01:40:34,929 --> 01:40:37,307
<i>is enough to hold back the darkness.</i>

909
01:40:39,017 --> 01:40:40,685
<i>It's facing unimaginable loss...</i>

910
01:40:43,355 --> 01:40:45,982
<i>and finding peace on the other side.</i>

911
01:40:55,200 --> 01:40:57,744
<i>It's lifting up the ones you love, knowing...</i>

912
01:41:00,789 --> 01:41:04,292
<i>that they'll be there to catch you when you fall.</i>

913
01:41:10,674 --> 01:41:12,509
<i>It's searching for greatness,</i>

914
01:41:14,969 --> 01:41:18,848
<i>then realizing you've had it
in you this entire time.</i>

915
01:41:20,767 --> 01:41:22,852
I say all of this to Raiden

916
01:41:22,936 --> 01:41:26,314
and he looks at me and he says...

917
01:41:27,023 --> 01:41:31,820
"You...
You have taught us so much, Mr. Cage.

918
01:41:32,821 --> 01:41:36,991
Thank you. Thank you
for sharing your wisdom."

919
01:41:37,951 --> 01:41:39,661
And you know what I tell him?

920
01:41:40,245 --> 01:41:41,496
What did you say?

921
01:41:42,038 --> 01:41:44,040
I said, "That ain't no wisdom, bub.

922
01:41:44,541 --> 01:41:47,210
That's perspective."

923
01:41:49,254 --> 01:41:52,424
Strange.
That is not how I remember it.

924
01:41:53,591 --> 01:41:54,926
Oh. Yo.

925
01:41:55,593 --> 01:41:57,345
I was just telling these guys

926
01:41:57,429 --> 01:42:00,098
how we saved all the realms, together.

927
01:42:00,181 --> 01:42:01,307
Oh.

928
01:42:01,808 --> 01:42:02,809
All right. Look...

929
01:42:03,560 --> 01:42:07,147
I may have taken one or two creative liberties.

930
01:42:07,939 --> 01:42:08,940
Behold!

931
01:42:09,441 --> 01:42:12,819
The human female you rescued
from the pit of spikes.

932
01:42:13,695 --> 01:42:14,612
Seriously?

933
01:42:15,280 --> 01:42:17,031
Two or three creative liberties.

934
01:42:17,532 --> 01:42:18,658
You know, I've got to give it to you,

935
01:42:18,742 --> 01:42:20,452
I thought you'd go running back to Hollywood

936
01:42:20,535 --> 01:42:21,536
first chance you got.

937
01:42:21,619 --> 01:42:23,788
I made a promise to these guys.

938
01:42:23,872 --> 01:42:25,415
Hollywood can wait.

939
01:42:27,500 --> 01:42:28,501
Oh, shit.

940
01:42:29,586 --> 01:42:30,920
Tell me there's not another tournament.

941
01:42:31,004 --> 01:42:33,173
No. Outworld has been defeated.

942
01:42:33,256 --> 01:42:34,424
Earthrealm has been saved.

943
01:42:35,592 --> 01:42:38,553
So, uh, what the fuck are you doing here?

944
01:42:38,636 --> 01:42:41,306
We have lost far too many of our champions.

945
01:42:41,389 --> 01:42:43,349
It's time to bring them home.

946
01:42:45,602 --> 01:42:47,312
Someone order a Necromancer?

947
01:42:47,896 --> 01:42:49,898
He might look like Voldemort's nut sack,

948
01:42:49,981 --> 01:42:52,317
but trust me, we're going to need this fucker.

949
01:42:53,651 --> 01:42:56,988
Hey, g'day, Blondie. Long time no see.

950
01:42:58,239 --> 01:42:59,949
You ready for your next lesson?

951
01:43:00,033 --> 01:43:02,410
For the glory of Johnny Fucking Cage.

952
01:43:05,914 --> 01:43:08,583
Let's go get our friends.
Then we kill Kano.

953
01:43:10,752 --> 01:43:12,212
Yeah. Good.